# 256-Line Cap

All 46 files <= 256 lines. Largest is mcp_graph_dynamic.oo at 255; test_t4_mcp_protocol.oo and cmd_mcp_test.oo are at 256 (cap).

# Generations G1-G30

G1  real-time: mcp_server_handle_body. G2 session: McpSession with R5 replay gate. G3 surface: tier-based method surface.
G4 transport: stdio + file + unix-socket. G5 graph: typed McpGraph (14 caps, 13 boards, 8 gates, substrate). G6 version: codexVersion + If-None-Match.
G7 dynamic: McpDynamicGraph. G8 gossip: mcp_gossip_merge dedup. G9 cold-start: mcp_dynamic_load. G10 redteam: 8 probes fire on close.
G11 cert: mcp_g11_self_certify exercises 14 caps (4 real + 9 via G30 real-cap probes + 1 bind). G12 federate: mcp_g12_federate_graphs.
G13 lineage: mcp_g13_lineage_record appends versioned NDJSON. G14 line-cch: mcp_g14_invalidate_caches fires on every G13.
G15 recover: mcp_redteam_recover. G16 attest: mcp_codex_re_attest. G17A chain: mcp_g17_lineage_verify. G17B reattest: mcp_g17_reattest_if_due.
G17C refold: mcp_g17_refold_after_quarantine. G17D gossip: AF_UNIX single-host. G17E bitmask: 14-bit via G19.
G18#6 config: $OODAREATTEST_INTERVAL. G18#7 heartbeat: mcp_g18_heartbeat_publish/fetch.
G19 caps-14: mcp_g19_token_to_bit / mcp_g19_bit_to_token / mcp_g19_caps_bitmask_from_graph; full mask = 16383.
G20N tcp-gossip: mcp_g20_tcp_publish/fetch. G20O compaction: mcp_g20_compaction_run. G20P notify-q: mcp_g20_revalidate_and_queue_caps + mcp_g20_drain_notifications.
G21R drain-rsp: mcp_g21_drain_into_response. G21S tcp-lived: mcp_g21_tcp_publish_long_lived + mcp_g21_tcp_fetch_long_lived.
G21T auto-comp: mcp_g21_auto_compact_if_due. G22V wired-comp: mcp_g21_auto_compact_if_due wired into mcp_server_run (interval=10, keep_recent=5).
G22W tcp-pub: mcp_g22_fed_tcp_publish(env, bind, tcp, instance_id, graph_json). G23 wire-W: mcp_g22_fed_tcp_publish wired into mcp_server_run.
G24 runner: test_all.oo dispatches to all 8 test files. G25 ooda-test: cmd_mcp_test.oo exposes `ooda mcp-test`.
G26 scheduler: mcp_g26_spawn/cancel/sleep_ms/spawn_periodic over runtime scheduler builtins. G27 push-hb: mcp_g27_start_push_heartbeat via G26.
G28 concur-acc: mcp_g28_start_accept_loop via G26. G29 wallclk: mcp_g29_start_wallclock_compact via G26.
G30 real-caps: mcp_g30_certify_real replaces the 9 skip caps in mcp_g11_self_certify with real runtime probes.

# Cap Chain (Zero-Ambient)

main(bind, fs, sys, env, time, fs_w, tcp, args)
  -> run_ooda_mcp(bind, fw, fs, env, sys, tcp, args)
    -> mcp_server_run(bind, fw, fs, env, t, tcp)
      -> mcp_transport_read(bind, fw, fs, t)
      -> mcp_g17_reattest_if_due (G18#6 env-driven)
      -> mcp_dynamic_load(fs, path) (G9)
      -> mcp_server_handle_body(fs, session, graph, codex, body)
        -> mcp_session_seen_id (R5)
        -> mcp_dispatch_decide (phase + tier + URI)
        -> mcp_dispatch_cap_audit (G19 14-bit, R7)
        -> mcp_dispatch_act_resource_read (uses cache.graph_json)
        -> mcp_dispatch_act_resource_read_stream (OODA streaming)
        -> mcp_g21_drain_into_response (G21R)
      -> mcp_dynamic_fold + mcp_gossip_merge (G7 + G8)
      -> mcp_redteam_run_all (G10)
      -> mcp_redteam_run_all_recovers (G15 -> G17C)
      -> mcp_g11_self_certify (G11, with G30 real-cap probes)
      -> mcp_g12_local_export (G12 -> G17D Unix gossip)
      -> mcp_g22_fed_tcp_publish (G23 multi-host TCP)
      -> mcp_codex_resolve_federated (G12b)
      -> mcp_g13_lineage_record -> G14 -> G17A (G13 -> G14 -> G17A)
      -> mcp_g21_auto_compact_if_due (G22V)
      -> mcp_g20_revalidate_and_queue_caps (G20P, enqueue)
      -> mcp_codex_re_attest (G16)

# REDTEAM R1-R8

R1 subversion: PASS — caps minted by runtime; G19 widens to 14 tokens. R2 exhaustion: PASS — 256-msg cap removed; loop terminates on shutdown/close/EOF.
R3 obfuscation: PASS — lsp_jsonrpc_escape on every string field. R4 injection: PASS — mcp_orient_uri_is_canonical gates URIs to 6 values.
R5 replay: PASS — mcp_session_seen_id returns -32603 on duplicate id. R6 traversal: PASS — mcp_sampling_root_allows rejects non-ooda:// outside roots.
R7 escalation: PASS (RUNTIME) — mcp_dispatch_cap_audit returns -32603 if caller lacks cap. R8 integrity: PASS — mcp_codex_substrate_attest computes live SHA-256 of LLMS.oot.

